### change the variable and its secret
--- plan
Target ma-cloud (managed-agents/cloud)

  ~ Vault/tools
      ~ credentials.gh.secretRef: "GH_PAT" -> "GH_PAT_2"
      ~ credentials.gh.variable: "GH_TOKEN" -> "GITHUB_TOKEN"
      note: sessions of Agent/reviewer attach it when they start

  ~ Agent/reviewer
      ~ vaults.tools.credentials: (113 bytes) -> (119 bytes)
      resolvedDigest: sha256:7b4060c52b2c -> sha256:85ed76a9cbdf
      note: creates a new agent version; sessions pinned to an earlier one keep it

